          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 15:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Rezini omugabe wa Siria na Peeka mwene Remalia omugabe wa Israeli bainamuka kuteera Yerusaalemu; baagota Ahazi, kwonka tibaabaasa kumusingura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.14.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 14:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebyo nimwo omugabe wa Edomu yaagaruriire Elaasi omuri Edomu, akabingamu abashaija ba Yuda; Abanyaedomu bakaija omuri Elaasi; bakagumamu n'okuhitsya hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 15:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 28:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Ahazi yaatuma entumwa ahari Tigulaasi-pileseeri omugabe wa Asiria, naagira ati: Ndi omwiru waawe kandi omwana waawe. Rugayo onjune omugabe wa Siria n'owa Israeli, abanteire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaatwara efeeza n'ezaabu ezaashangirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu mabikiro g'enju y'omugabe, yaabitoijera omugabe wa Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe wa Asiria yaamwikiriza, yaahurura, yaateera Damasiko, yaagikwata, n'abantu baamwo yaabatwara Kiiri bari enkwatwa, kandi yaita na Reziini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 8:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe Ahazi ku yaagiire Damasiko kubugana Tigulaasi-pileseeri omugabe wa Asiria, yaareebayo eitambiro. Yaatwekyera Uriya omunyamurwa eky'okureeberaho ky'eryo itambiro, ekyabaire nikishushanira kimwe naryo omu miringo yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya omunyamurwa yaayombeka eryo itambiro, naarishushanisiza kimwe n'ebi omugabe Ahazi yaatwekire ari Damasiko byona; atyo ogwo munyamurwa yaarikora, omugabe Ahazi atakagarukire naaruga Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.26.16+2CH.26.17+2CH.26.18+2CH.26.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 26:16-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe ku yaarugire Damasiko, yaareeba eitambiro; bwanyima yaariirira haihi, yaaritembaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaaryokyezaho ekitambo kye ky'okwotsya n'empongano ye y'esaano, yaarishukaho empongano ye y'eky'okunywa, kandi yaarishukyera eshagama y'empongano ze ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.40.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 40:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.40.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi eitambiro ry'emiringa eryabaire rituura omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaariiha omu maisho g'enju omu mwanya gwaryo ahagati y'eitambiro rye n'enju ya MUKAMA, yaarita aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho obw'eitambiro rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.39+EXO.29.40+EXO.29.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 29:39-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe Ahazi yaaragiira Uriya omunyamurwa naagira ati: Aha itabiro erihango obe niho waaguma nooyokyeza ekitambo ekyokibwa omu kasheeshe, n'empongano y'esaano ey'omumwabazyo, n'ekitambo ky'omugabe eky'okwotsya n'empongano ye ey'esaano, hamwe n'ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'abantu boona ab'eryo ihanga n'empongano yaabyo ey'esaano n'ey'ebyokunywa; kandi orishukyere eshangama yoona ey'ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'ey'ebindi bitambo; kwonka eitambiro ry'emiringa rigume ribe eryangye ery'okwehanuurizaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya omunyamurwa yaakora ebyo byona, nk'oku omugabe Ahazi yaamuragiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
