        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima omugabe Ahazi yaashara aha binaabiro ebiremu by'ebitebe byabyo, yaiha ahari buri kimwe ekinaabiro kyakyo; kandi yaiha ekitanka aha nimi z'emiringa ezaabaire ziri ahansi yaakyo, yaakita aha mabaare agaariire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
